{%- if rb_part == 'glance' -%}
<p class="lead pdp__glance">Comfort for your little explorer. The Bodhi pairs finely ground, skin-soothing Oatmeal with anti-inflammatory Calendula petals to wrap reactive skin in a gentle blanket of relief. This extra-mild bar is specifically built to calm playground scrapes, itchy bug bites, and dry patches without stripping away natural moisture.</p>
{%- else -%}
<div class="acc open">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="true">Description<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte">
    <h3>The Science and Targeted Therapeutic Benefits</h3>
    <p>The Bodhi is a dedicated soothing sanctuary built specifically for little explorers who love getting messy. It serves as a gentle botanical blanket to comfort irritated skin, dry patches, and playground scrapes. This extra-mild block completely avoids intense essential oils, relying instead on raw, calming grains and flowers.</p>
    <h3>Key Skin Benefits</h3>
    <ul>
                    <li>Colloidal Oatmeal (Avena Sativa): A legendary skin protector It binds to the skin and creates a defensive physical barrier locking in heavy moisture while instantly relieving itchiness from bug bites, rashes, or eczema flares</li>
                    <li>Calendula Flower Extract (Calendula Officinalis): Known as marigold, this powerful botanical accelerates surface skin tissue healing, reduces redness on raw areas, and provides gentle antibacterial defense for minor cuts</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Best For:</strong> Sensitive, irritated, or eczema-prone skin.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">Ingredients<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte"><p>Oatmeal Base, Honey Base, Aloe Vera Base, Shea Butter Base, Organic Lavender Oil, Organic Roman Chamomile Oil, Sweet Orange Oil, Organic Calendula Oil, Oatmeal, Natural Coloring, and Natural Preservative.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">The Ritual<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte"><p>Glide the soothing bar gently over irritated areas during bath time without scrubbing.</p></div>
</div>
{% render 'rb-acc-care' %}
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">Storage / Safety Disclaimer<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte">
    <p><strong>Safety Disclaimer:</strong> For external use only. Avoid direct contact with eyes. In case of contact, rinse thoroughly with water. Discontinue use immediately if irritation, redness, or rash occurs. Consult a healthcare professional if irritation persists. Keep out of reach of infants without supervision.</p>
    <p><strong>Aromatherapy &amp; Herbal Note:</strong> This product is hand-crafted with active botanicals, natural clays, and pure essential oils. We recommend performing a patch test on a small area of skin before your first full use. If you are pregnant, nursing, or under medical supervision, consult your physician before using bars containing high concentrations of essential oils.</p>
  </div>
</div>
{% render 'rb-acc-shipping' %}
{%- endif -%}
